  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EU-UN Joint Programme on Improving Vocational Education in Abkhazia, Georgia increases the quality, effectiveness and accessibility of vocational education and training (VET) in Abkhazia&#x202f;for children, young people, women and men addressing their actual needs and building their skills and capacity to improve their employability and self-employment  irrespective of their nationality n residence.</narrative>
